# Default destination secrets overrides (safe for git — DO NOT put raw secrets here).
# Shared environment mappings live in `.kamal/secrets-common`.
#
# For destination-specific secrets (e.g. `-d managed`, `-d cluster`, `-d staging`),
# create `.kamal/secrets.<destination>` or fetch from a secret manager:
#
# SECRETS=$(kamal secrets fetch --adapter 1password --account my.1password.com --from Vault/Forem SECRET_KEY_BASE DATABASE_URL)
# SECRET_KEY_BASE=$(kamal secrets extract SECRET_KEY_BASE $SECRETS)
